   │ Note: a reading is a theorem `test = True ↔ P` or `test = False ↔ P`, whose test is a function applied to the theorem's parameters, each once: `@[reading] theorem List.anyReads (xs: List a) (f: a → Bool): xs.any f ↔ ∃ (x: a) => x ∈ xs ∧ f x`
